Recommends: lxqt-policykit
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://edukasaunos.tl
Description: multilingual web and Squid protection for Edukasaun OS
 Eduka-Block is a lightweight GTK application for parents and teachers.
 Its subtle 3D, theme-adaptive GTK interface combines wildcard DNS, a managed
 /etc/hosts section, persistent nftables rules, periodic smart IP
 synchronization and optional Squid keyword ACLs. Rules can be imported from
 plain lists or hosts files and exported for other computers. The interface
 includes English, Tetum, European and Brazilian Portuguese, and Indonesian.
